   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "ROOMES39:15bc6",
   "off": 89030,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "国王の姿を見て 兵士達は\r唖然としている\u0010\bしかし すぐに直立不動で\r敬礼した\u0010\b",
   "en": "The soldiers stared dumbfounded at the sight of the King.\u0010\bBut at once they snapped to attention and saluted.\u0010\b",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "ROOMES39:15c12",
   "off": 89106,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "奥の部屋からシーダが\r出てきて 国王に抱きついた\u0010",
   "en": "Sheeda came out of the back room and threw her arms around the King.\u0010",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "ROOMES39:15c43",
   "off": 89155,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "\b",
   "en": "",
   "kind": "data",
   "status": "",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "ROOMES39:15c48",
   "off": 89160,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "国王は司令官から牙の印の鍵\rを受け取ると フィンに手渡\rした\u0010",
   "en": "The King took the Fang Crest Key from the commander and handed it to Finn.\u0010",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "ROOMES39:15c84",
   "off": 89220,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "\b",
   "en": "",
   "kind": "data",
   "status": "",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "ROOMES39:15c89",
   "off": 89225,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "牙の印の鍵を手に入れた\u0010",
   "en": "Got the Fang Crest Key!\u0010",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "ROOMES39:15cb5",
   "off": 89269,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "「いったい､国王は…\r\u0017  軍をあげて捜索している\r  んだが…」\u0010\b",
   "en": "\"Where in the world could the King be... \u0017We've had the whole army searching, but...\"\u0010\b",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "ROOMES39:15cf6",
   "off": 89334,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "「我々に命令を下すことが\r  出来るのは 国王陛下\r  だけだ」\u0010",
   "en": "\"Only His Majesty the King can give us orders.\"\u0010",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "ROOMES39:15d3c",
   "off": 89404,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "「アモーク要塞に兵士を\r  派遣しているのだが…\u0010\b",
   "en": "\"We've sent soldiers to Fort Amok...\u0010\b",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "ROOMES39:15d6d",
   "off": 89453,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "  まだ､良い連絡は\r  届かない…」\u0010\b",
   "en": "No good news has come back yet...\"\u0010\b",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "ROOMES39:15d94",
   "off": 89492,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "「昨日まで 牙の紋章の\r  迷宮の警備にあたって\r  いたんだが…」\u0010",
   "en": "\"Until yesterday, we were standing guard over the Fang Crest Labyrinth, but...\"\u0010",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "ROOMES39:15dde",
   "off": 89566,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "「国王陛下は\r  牙の印の鍵を持ったまま\r  行方不明に…\u0010\b",
   "en": "\"His Majesty went missing with the Fang Crest Key still in his keeping...\u0010\b",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "ROOMES39:15e16",
   "off": 89622,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "  もしや､あのデミウスに\r  連れ去られたのでは…」\u0010\b",
   "en": "Could it be that Demius took him...?\"\u0010\b",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "ROOMES39:15e4d",
   "off": 89677,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "「これからは国王とともに\r  アンブローズの復興に\r  励みたいと思います」\u0010\b",
   "en": "\"From now on, I hope to devote myself to rebuilding Ambrose alongside the King.\"\u0010\b",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  }
 ]
}
